# ── DEV / SANDBOX database for IMS (Phase H1+) work ──────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env.dev` and fill in a THROWAWAY/empty Postgres connection.
# ⚠️ NEVER point this at the production DB. The `sandbox:*` npm scripts
#    (sandbox:migrate:dev / sandbox:seed / sandbox:studio) load THIS file, kept
#    separate from `.env.local` (which targets prod) so the two can't be confused.
#
# Easiest source: a new free Supabase project (Settings → Database → Connection
# string). Use the pooled (6543) URL for DATABASE_URL and the direct (5432) URL
# for DIRECT_URL — same split as prod. A local Postgres works too.
#
# `prisma migrate dev` + `prisma/seed.ts` only need these two vars (the app's
# other env — AUTH_SECRET, RESEND_*, etc. — is only read when the server boots,
# not during migrate/seed).

DATABASE_URL=
DIRECT_URL=
